                "title": "Arts and Crafts Plate with Windsor Knob, Brass Accents D05-K533-WIN",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K533-WIN, Arts and Crafts Plate with Windsor Knob -The egg-shaped knob is a true classic; and when it is paired with the unique plate, the Arts and Crafts Plate with Windsor Knob has a beautiful style that is reminiscent of the 1920's. Choose from a wide array of finishes including satin nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and antique brass. The Arts and Crafts Plate with Egg Windsor Knob is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
